                <invention-title lang="de">LAUTSPRECHERANORDNUNGEN UND OHRHÖRER</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">ENSEMBLES HAUT-PARLEURS ET ÉCOUTEURS</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">SPEAKER ASSEMBLIES AND EARPHONES</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A speaker assembly and an earphone are provided. The speaker assembly includes a housing assembly, a bone conduction speaker, and an air conduction speaker. The housing assembly includes a main housing forming an accommodation space with an open end. The bone conduction speaker includes a core shell and a transducer. The core shell is rotatably supported on the main housing and partially located in the accommodation space. The core shell is provided with a mounting space, and a volume of the mounting space is smaller than a volume of the accommodation space. The transducer is provided in the mounting space. The core shell is provided with a sound guiding hole in flow communication with the mounting space. In this way, the speaker assembly has a better acoustic performance.</p>
            </abstract>
